-- pages 2-29).
--
-- Money is Vietnamese đồng (VND) as a bare NUMBER. Rates are NUMBERs (10% is 0.1).
-- Membership test for this module: a witness of ordinary competence could testify to the fact,
-- or a document the parties hold records it (the policy, a certificate, an invoice, a police
-- record, an assessment report, a decision Tasco has recorded). Whether the fact makes a loss
-- payable is a rule, and belongs in the chapter module that says so.

§ `Nouns`

§§ `The parties (Article 1.1 to 1.6)`

-- Article 1 defines the parties to and around the contract.
