    `a car`                         -- Article 1.7, "Xe ô tô": four wheels or more
    `a low-speed electric vehicle`  -- Article 1.7.7, "Xe điện": at most 15 seats, at most 30 km/h
    `a special-purpose machine`     -- Article 1.7.9, "Xe máy chuyên dùng"
